  // ---- fusee ----
  ['The mainspring lives in a drum: a coiled ribbon hooked to the drum wall at its outer end (the hook is riveted <em>into</em> the wall — a declared joint the intra-unit instrument checks). As it unwinds, its torque falls — a spring near full wind pulls much harder than one near empty, and a train driven directly would beat measurably differently across the reserve.']: '发条装在条盒里：一条盘绕的钢带，其外端钩在条盒壁上（钩子是铆<em>进</em>盒壁的——一处已申报的连接，由单元内仪器检查）。发条释放时扭矩下降——接近满弦的发条比接近放尽时拉力大得多，若轮系被直接驱动，走时在整段动力储备内会有可测量的差异。',
  ['The fusee is the correction: a cone with a spiral chain groove, chained to the drum. Fully wound, the chain pulls at the cone\'s <em>small</em> radius — high spring force, short lever. As the spring runs down the chain works toward the <em>large</em> radius — weaker force, longer lever. The product, torque into the train, stays near constant. Winding spools the chain back onto the fusee; a maintaining detent keeps the train driven while the wind briefly unloads it, so the escapement never runs backward.']: '塔轮就是这项修正：一个带螺旋链槽的锥体，用链条与条盒相连。满弦时链条作用在锥体的<em>小</em>半径上——发条力大，力臂短。发条释放后，链条移向<em>大</em>半径——力变弱，力臂变长。二者之积，即输入轮系的扭矩，几乎保持恒定。上弦时链条重新卷回塔轮；上弦短暂卸载轮系期间，由维持动力棘爪继续驱动轮系，因此擒纵机构绝不会倒转。',
  ['Honesty ledger: TODO 1 is half-closed — the spring\'s torque law is still partly authored rather than emerging from ribbon mechanics; the chain\'s swept fan is a first-class obstacle in the layout (§36\'s registry).']: '诚实台账：TODO 1 已关闭一半——发条的扭矩规律仍有一部分是写定的，而非由钢带力学自然得出；链条的扫掠扇面在布局中是一等障碍物（§36 的登记表）。',
  ['The graph is the HUD\'s own law, not an illustration: <code>springTq = 0.35 + 0.65·reserve</code>, <code>trainTq = springTq · fuseeR / FUSEE_R_SMALL</code> — at empty, 0.35 × 7.4 / 2.6 = 0.996. The two torque bars in the sim\'s Time panel display exactly these expressions; the cone\'s r 2.6 → 7.4 spiral (with its §61 grooves) is the geometry that makes the red line flat.']: '此图就是 HUD 自身的规律，而非示意：<code>springTq = 0.35 + 0.65·reserve</code>，<code>trainTq = springTq · fuseeR / FUSEE_R_SMALL</code>——放尽时 0.35 × 7.4 / 2.6 = 0.996。模拟器时间面板中的两条扭矩条显示的正是这两个表达式；锥体 r 2.6 → 7.4 的螺旋（含 §61 的沟槽）就是让红线保持水平的几何。',
