  // ---- escapement ----
  ['The balance and its hairspring are the oscillator; everything else exists to keep it swinging and to count its swings. Each beat is a fixed sequence of mechanical contacts, and the source builds every one by name (<code>makePalletFork</code>): the stone\'s locking corner solved <em>onto</em> the wheel\'s tooth circle, the impulse face cut as the plane through that corner, and draw ("LEAN") as a locking face angled so the wheel\'s own pressure pulls the fork <em>deeper</em> into its banking — with a draw-torque-sign assert, because a draw that pushes the wrong way unlocks itself.']: '摆轮与游丝是振荡器；其余一切的存在，都是为了让它持续摆动并数它的摆动。每一次半振动都是一串固定的机械接触，源码逐一具名地构建了它们（<code>makePalletFork</code>）：瓦石的锁角被求解<em>到</em>擒纵轮的齿圆上，冲击面被切成过该角的平面，而抽力（"LEAN"）则是一个带倾角的锁面，使擒纵轮自身的压力把擒纵叉<em>更深地</em>拉向限位——并附有抽力扭矩符号的断言，因为方向相反的抽力会自行解锁。',
  ['"Swiss" names the DESIGN, not a provenance — and this build earns the name in geometry: the straight-line layout (escape centre, fork pivot, and balance centre measure exactly collinear — 180.0° at the fork, from <code>solveLayout</code>\'s own P table) and a 15-tooth CLUB-TOOTH wheel, the impulse shared between tooth face and stone. A German-styled movement carrying a Swiss lever is the industry\'s norm, Glashütte\'s included; the historical <em>Glashütter Ankerhemmung</em> is a distinct variant of the lever family, and not what is built here.']: '“瑞士式”指的是设计，而非产地——本机芯在几何上当得起这个名字：直线式布局（擒纵轮中心、擒纵叉支点与摆轮中心实测严格共线——擒纵叉处 180.0°，取自 <code>solveLayout</code> 自己的 P 表），以及 15 齿的棒齿式擒纵轮，冲击由齿面与瓦石共同承担。德国风格的机芯配瑞士杠杆式擒纵是业界常态，格拉苏蒂亦然；历史上的 <em>Glashütter Ankerhemmung</em> 是杠杆家族中另一个独立变体，并非此处所建。',
  ['Ledger: the tick models the escapement KINEMATICALLY — the wheel\'s angle is a law of balance phase; forces, lift angles and safety-action dynamics are not simulated (the drawn contacts are the built geometry\'s, the motion law is the shipped one). The pallet stones seat in slots whose gap is DERIVED from the arm\'s own extrude bevel (<code>gGap = armBevel + SEAT_SHOW</code>) — a guard born from a defect every battery run missed; that seat is also TODO 5\'s fixture-vs-fixture residue: the one intra-unit pair class the interim instrument still cannot see. Banking: <code>FORK_BANK_DEG = rollerR·Δθ_pin / notchDepth / 2</code>, derived, with <code>FORK_RECOIL_DEG</code> at a quarter of it.']: '台账：tick 对擒纵机构做的是运动学建模——擒纵轮的角度是摆轮相位的函数；受力、抬起角与安全装置动力学并未模拟（所画的接触取自已建几何，运动规律即已发布的那一个）。瓦石坐在槽中，槽的间隙由叉臂自身的挤出倒角推导而来（<code>gGap = armBevel + SEAT_SHOW</code>）——这道防线源自一个每次电池检测都漏掉的缺陷；该槽座同时也是 TODO 5 的“固定件对固定件”残留：过渡仪器至今看不见的那一类单元内配对。限位：<code>FORK_BANK_DEG = rollerR·Δθ_pin / notchDepth / 2</code>，推导而得，<code>FORK_RECOIL_DEG</code> 取其四分之一。',
  ['Lock is a contact, not a state: the tooth stands on the stone\'s locking face and the face\'s LEAN converts wheel torque into a pull toward the banking (draw) — asserted at build with the torque sign written out. Unlock spends real wheel motion (the −1.0° recoil in the law below is draw made visible). Banking is derived from the arc-length match <code>rollerR·Δθ = notchDepth·2·bank</code> — without it the pin and notch never coincide. The play loop walks the panels in beat order and drives every pose through the same ported law plate 2 scrubs (<code>escapeDeltaDeg</code> / <code>forkSwingRad</code>); only DISPLAY time is dilated, since the whole action is 16% of the beat. Paused, the plate is exactly its four keyframes.']: '锁止是一次接触，不是一个状态：齿停在瓦石的锁面上，而该面的倾角把擒纵轮扭矩转化为指向限位的拉力（抽力）——构建时以写明的扭矩符号加以断言。解锁要花掉真实的轮转（下方规律中 −1.0° 的回退，就是被看见的抽力）。限位由弧长相等式 <code>rollerR·Δθ = notchDepth·2·bank</code> 推得——没有它，圆盘钉与叉口永远对不上。播放循环按半振动顺序走过各分格，并用图版 2 所拖动的同一套移植规律驱动每一个姿态（<code>escapeDeltaDeg</code> / <code>forkSwingRad</code>）；被拉长的只是显示时间，因为整个动作只占半振动的 16%。暂停时，本图版恰好就是它的四张关键帧。',
  ['Ported arithmetic, not an animation: the curves are <code>escapeDeltaDeg(p)</code> and <code>forkSwingRad</code> exactly as the tick computes them — recoil dip of <code>RECOIL_DEG = 1.0°</code> over the first quarter of the impulse window (<code>RECOIL_FRACTION = 0.25</code>), smoothstep advance of <code>BEAT_DEG = 12°</code> (half the 24° tooth pitch), all inside <code>IMPULSE_WIDTH = 0.16</code> of the beat; the remaining 84% is lock, with the balance detached. The wheel\'s angle is <code>n·BEAT_DEG + Δ(p)</code> — the whole train hangs off this one function, never integrated, so it cannot drift.']: '这是移植过来的算术，不是动画：曲线就是 tick 所计算的 <code>escapeDeltaDeg(p)</code> 与 <code>forkSwingRad</code>——在冲击窗口的前四分之一内出现 <code>RECOIL_DEG = 1.0°</code> 的回退凹陷（<code>RECOIL_FRACTION = 0.25</code>），随后是 <code>BEAT_DEG = 12°</code> 的平滑步进（24° 齿距的一半），全部发生在半振动的 <code>IMPULSE_WIDTH = 0.16</code> 之内；其余 84% 是锁止，摆轮与之脱离。擒纵轮的角度是 <code>n·BEAT_DEG + Δ(p)</code>——整个轮系都挂在这一个函数上，从不做积分，因此不会漂移。',
