  // ---- free-sprung ----
  ['There is deliberately <em>no</em> regulator on this balance: no index arm, no curb pins — the hairspring\'s terminal curve runs uninterrupted to its stud (the build\'s own comment: "FREE-SPRUNG: there is deliberately NO regulator"). On an indexed watch the curb pins pinch the spring to shorten its acting length; free-sprung watches delete that interference and put the rate in the balance\'s own inertia instead — the <b>timing screws</b> threaded into the rim. Screwing a pair in reduces the moment of inertia and the watch gains; out, it loses. The spring is never touched.']: '这枚摆轮上刻意<em>没有</em>快慢针：没有快慢针臂，也没有快慢夹——游丝的末端曲线毫无阻碍地通向其外桩（构建代码自己的注释：“FREE-SPRUNG: there is deliberately NO regulator”）。带快慢针的表用快慢夹夹住游丝以缩短其有效长度；无快慢针的表取消这一干预，改把走时快慢交给摆轮自身的转动惯量——即旋入摆轮缘的<b>微调螺钉</b>。把一对螺钉旋进去，转动惯量减小，表走快；旋出来则走慢。游丝始终不被触碰。',
